[h2]Build 0.9.133[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*]Repair bills on the industrial repair center have two new options in their details window: [b]Repair gear that needs components[/b] and [b]Repair gear that needs advanced components[/b]. Untick one and the bill skips gear whose repair would cost that component (judged from the actual repair cost, after any core saving), passing it on to the next bill - or out a reject chute if no bill takes it. Both start ticked, so existing bills are unchanged.
[/list]
